      "body": "> LGTM — the fix correctly releases `token_indices` and `token_probs` in `_DeepepManager.combine()`, matching the existing pattern for `dispatched_indices`/`dispatched_probs`.\r\n> \r\n> **Non-blocking note:** `_HybridEPManager.combine()` (line ~1120) has a similar pattern — it stores `self.token_probs` and `self.dispatched_probs` during `setup_metadata`/`dispatch` but does not release them in `combine()`. Might be worth a follow-up to apply the same cleanup there.\r\n\r\n@yuyang66 Thanks for the PR. Could you also address the same pattern for the HybridEP combine?",
      "created_at": "2026-06-12T16:51:53Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/5227#issuecomment-4693353018",
      "id": 4693353018,
      "updated_at": "2026-06-12T16:51:53Z",
