      }
    },
    {
      "body": "@yuyang66 Are you running with cuda graphs? Actually after checking the code these are registered as `cudagraph_attrs `: https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/megatron/core/transformer/moe/token_dispatcher.py#L1430, cuda graph will use them as outputs and always re-register them to the dispatcher after mlp post-process. Technically speaking deallocate is not harmful, but it would be save to keep them when partial cuda graph is enabled.",
